{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://takto.online/contracts/tenant-configuration.v1.schema.json",
  "title": "TenantConfigurationV1 (IMPLEMENTADO en la Fase 2; capacidades efectivas en la Fase 4)",
  "description": "Respuesta de GET y PATCH /companies/me/configuration. Contrato agregado y versionado APARTE de la forma de almacenamiento de Company.settings (v0/v1/v2, ver company-settings.v2.schema.json). Se compone de tres fuentes sin duplicarlas: columnas de Company (región, tipo de negocio manual), Company.settings (banderas, módulos, categorías, plantilla de origen) y pipelines/pipeline_stages (pipeline real). Implementación: apps/backend/src/modules/companies/tenant-configuration.ts y tenant-configuration.service.ts. Una prueba (tenant-configuration.contract.spec.ts) valida una respuesta real del motor contra este esquema.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "contractVersion": {
      "type": "integer",
      "const": 1
    },
    "storageVersion": {
      "type": "integer",
      "enum": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "description": "Forma real guardada en Company.settings: 0 sin settings, 1 forma antigua, 2 forma actual. Leer nunca la cambia."
    },
    "identity": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Metadatos de origen (plantilla de onboarding) y modelo comercial DERIVADO de las banderas actuales. No editable por este contrato.",
      "properties": {
        "industry": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "businessType": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "businessModel": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            "products",
            "services",
            "mixed",
            null
          ]
        },
        "templateVersion": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "industry",
        "businessType",
        "businessModel",
        "templateVersion"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "regional": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Fuente canónica: columnas de Company. Siempre válidas en la respuesta (una columna con texto inválido histórico se responde con el default del producto, sin reescribir).",
      "properties": {
        "country": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 80
        },
        "timezone": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64,
          "description": "IANA canónica, p. ej. America/Bogota"
        },
        "currency": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$",
          "description": "ISO 4217"
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 35,
          "description": "BCP 47 canónica, p. ej. es-CO"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "country",
        "timezone",
        "currency",
        "locale"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "modules": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "conversations": {
          "const": true
        },
        "contacts": {
          "const": true
        },
        "opportunities": {
          "const": true
        },
        "pipeline": {
          "const": true
        },
        "catalog": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "quotes": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "tasks": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "conversations",
        "contacts",
        "opportunities",
        "pipeline",
        "catalog",
        "quotes",
        "tasks"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Módulos EFECTIVOS (Fase 4): los centrales siempre true; los opcionales salen de las banderas declaradas y, si una empresa nunca declaró una bandera (v0 o v1 sin ella), se resuelve activa por compatibilidad. Desactivar un módulo nunca borra sus datos."
    },
    "catalog": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "categories": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 60
          },
          "maxItems": 30,
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "allowFreeText": {
          "const": true
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "categories",
        "allowFreeText"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "pipeline": {
      "description": "Pipeline real de la empresa (isDefault no archivado; si no hay uno marcado, el primero no archivado por order, createdAt, id). null si la empresa no tiene ninguno.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "stages": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "OPEN",
                      "WON",
                      "LOST"
                    ]
                  },
                  "isInitial": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "order": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id",
                  "name",
                  "type",
                  "isInitial",
                  "order"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "id",
            "name",
            "stages"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "limits": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "categories": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "maxLength": {
              "const": 60
            },
            "maxCount": {
              "const": 30
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "maxLength",
            "maxCount"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "regional": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "country": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "maxLength": {
                  "const": 80
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "maxLength"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "timezone": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "maxLength": {
                  "const": 64
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "maxLength"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "currency": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "length": {
                  "const": 3
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "length"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "locale": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "maxLength": {
                  "const": 35
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "maxLength"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "country",
            "timezone",
            "currency",
            "locale"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "categories",
        "regional"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "capabilities": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Capacidades efectivas (Fase 4). Acompaña a modules con lo que explica el resultado: qué opcionales quedaron activos por compatibilidad, qué tipos de catálogo puede crear la empresa según su modelo comercial y el registro de definiciones (etiqueta, descripción, dependencias) que la interfaz muestra sin duplicar el contrato.",
      "properties": {
        "legacyDefaultsApplied": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "catalog",
              "quotes",
              "tasks"
            ]
          },
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "catalog": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "allowedItemTypes": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "PRODUCT",
                  "SERVICE"
                ]
              },
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 2,
              "uniqueItems": true
            },
            "defaultItemType": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PRODUCT",
                "SERVICE"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "allowedItemTypes",
            "defaultItemType"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "definitions": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 7,
          "maxItems": 7,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "key": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "conversations",
                  "contacts",
                  "opportunities",
                  "pipeline",
                  "catalog",
                  "quotes",
                  "tasks"
                ]
              },
              "label": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "group": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "core",
                  "commercial"
                ]
              },
              "alwaysOn": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "configurable": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "dependsOn": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "catalog",
                    "quotes",
                    "tasks"
                  ]
                },
                "uniqueItems": true
              },
              "relatedTo": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "catalog",
                    "quotes",
                    "tasks"
                  ]
                },
                "uniqueItems": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "key",
              "label",
              "description",
              "group",
              "alwaysOn",
              "configurable",
              "dependsOn",
              "relatedTo"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "legacyDefaultsApplied",
        "catalog",
        "definitions"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "contractVersion",
    "storageVersion",
    "identity",
    "regional",
    "modules",
    "capabilities",
    "catalog",
    "pipeline",
    "limits"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "x-phase2": {
    "status": "IMPLEMENTED",
    "implementedAt": "2026-09-03",
    "endpoints": {
      "GET /companies/me/configuration": "cualquier rol de la empresa (AuthGuard jwt + BusinessTenantGuard)",
      "PATCH /companies/me/configuration": "ADMIN o SUPER_ADMIN con empresa; cuerpo = UpdateTenantConfigurationDto",
      "GET /companies/me/settings": "compatibilidad (vista de company-settings.v2.schema.json#/$defs/publicView), delega en el mismo motor",
      "PATCH /companies/me/settings": "compatibilidad, delega en el mismo motor (misma transacción, reglas y auditoría)"
    },
    "patch": {
      "editable": {
        "regional": [
          "country (texto libre, max 80, null limpia)",
          "timezone (IANA)",
          "currency (ISO 4217, se normaliza a mayúsculas)",
          "locale (BCP 47, se canonicaliza)"
        ],
        "commercial": [
          "sellsProducts",
          "sellsServices"
        ],
        "modules": [
          "catalog",
          "quotes",
          "tasks"
        ],
        "catalog": [
          "categories"
        ]
      },
      "rejected400": [
        "settings",
        "storageVersion",
        "contractVersion",
        "identity",
        "pipeline",
        "pipelineDefaults",
        "companyId",
        "id",
        "limits",
        "cualquier clave desconocida (whitelist + forbidNonWhitelisted)",
        "ambas ventas en falso tras una edición explícita del modelo comercial"
      ],
      "rules": [
        "GET nunca escribe; storageVersion refleja lo guardado",
        "un parche solo regional escribe columnas y no reescribe settings (v1 sigue v1)",
        "editar commercial/modules/catalog escribe settings v2 conservando vertical, pipelineDefaults y claves desconocidas",
        "desactivar un módulo no elimina categorías, productos, cotizaciones ni tareas",
        "toda escritura ocurre en una transacción con SELECT ... FOR UPDATE sobre la fila de companies",
        "cada escritura deja una fila en audit_logs (action company.configuration.update, entityType Company) con secciones y campos tocados, sin valores"
      ]
    },
    "consumers": [
      "apps/frontend/src/lib/tenant-configuration.ts (cliente, tipos, hook)",
      "apps/frontend/src/components/settings/TenantConfigurationSection.tsx (Configuración → Empresa)",
      "apps/frontend/src/components/settings/CompanyCategoriesEditor.tsx (categorías)"
    ]
  },
  "x-phase4": {
    "status": "IMPLEMENTED",
    "implementedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "notes": [
      "modules pasa a ser el resultado efectivo (regla legacy: no declarado = activo)",
      "capabilities es nuevo y aditivo",
      "la API responde 403 {code: MODULE_DISABLED, module} en los endpoints gobernados por un módulo desactivado (ver docs/phase-4/MODULE-MATRIX.md)"
    ]
  }
}
